_olex2_refinement_description
;
1. Fixed Uiso
 At 1.2 times of:
  All C(H) groups, All C(H,H) groups, All N(H,H,H) groups
 At 1.5 times of:
  All C(H,H,H) groups
2. Restrained distances
 C5-C3 \\sim C9-C5 \\sim C7-C5 \\sim C9-C2
 with sigma of 0.02
 C6-C4 \\sim C8-C4 \\sim C8-C1 \\sim C4-C10
 with sigma of 0.02
3.a Ternary CH refined with riding coordinates:
 C4(H4), C5(H5)
3.b Secondary CH2 refined with riding coordinates:
 C3(H3A,H3B), C6(H6A,H6B), C8(H8A,H8B), C9(H9A,H9B)
3.c Idealised Me refined as rotating group:
 N1(H1A,H1B,H1C), N2(H2D,H2E,H2F), C7(H7A,H7B,H7C), C10(H10A,H10B,H10C),
 C1(H1D,H1E,H1F), C2(H2A,H2B,H2C)
;
